WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.860
I'm going to go pro!

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.780
I'll become a professional
wrestler and beat you!

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:08.410
Now it's getting interesting!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:12.200
Sakura Hagiwara
To be a girls' pro wrestler
Retiring from Sweet?!

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:20.880
I understand that
I'm causing problems here.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.290
But, I...

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.760
I want to beat her for mocking our pride!

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.970
Our pride?

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:33.850
Our pride as idols. As the Sweet Diva.

00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:41.480
Okay then. Just do what you have to do.

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:43.520
Is that okay, Makoto-<i>san</i>?!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:47.610
We're going to lose our
center vocal from Sweet Diva!

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.490
Elena wouldn't want that to happen...

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.290
Elena...

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:57.580
Huh?

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:58.460
Elena?!

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.080
Elena-<i>san</i>?

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:04.540
Isn't this a harsh blow with
the departure of the center vocal?

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.260
What are the plans for Sweet Diva now?

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.680
I'll lead the Sweet Diva.

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:15.140
That's the decision I made.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:19.680
Does that mean you're going
to take the center vocal position?

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.730
Sweet Diva's center vocal is Sakura.

00:01:22.940 --> 00:01:27.070
I'll just do what I need to do.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.240
Elena...

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:34.070
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.240
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:45.880
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:59.140
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:04.650
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:10.280
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:15.320
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:20.870
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:26.250
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.130
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:35.800
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.510
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.730
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:46.810
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.650
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.740
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:02:52.940 --> 00:03:00.240
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:06.370
Episode 02: Pro Debut!

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:10.430
Thank you very much for accepting
such a troublesome request!

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:10.420
President's Room

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:11.390
I...

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:14.730
Ah, never mind that.

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:17.360
All you want to do is
become stronger, right?

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.690
Let's skip all the formalities...

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:23.070
and spend every second on your training.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:24.570
Yes!

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.530
Now that's a good reply!

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:28.120
Nishihara!

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:29.040
Yes?

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:31.120
She's our rookie joining us for today.

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:33.210
Can you take care of her?

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.460
Will do.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.710
I'm the coach, Ryo Nishihara.

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:39.960
Pleased to meet you!

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:43.510
Now then, let's see how good she is.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.680
All right then,
let's check out your physicals.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:48.060
Follow me.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.680
Yes!

00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:54.600
Isn't it today...

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:57.110
that idol is going to be with us?

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.860
She's just going to give up anyways.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:02.440
This isn't something you
can do for play or anything.

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.530
I heard Ryo-<i>san</i> is going to be the coach.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:08.660
Yikes... She may not even
make it through today then.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:12.330
Morning! Please coach...

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.760
Good.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:25.050
Take a thirty second break.

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:26.590
Bench press?

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.550
Is this a twenty set course?!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.140
That's the same routine as us!

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:32.310
Yeah.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:36.060
She's already done with her
thousand squats and hundred push-ups.

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:37.480
No way!

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:39.900
I can't believe it...

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.900
This is the ability of the center vocalist

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:46.610
of the popular idol group.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:58.920
Hey!

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:01.290
You girls get started with your training!

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:03.550
Y-Yes!

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.050
Th-This is exhausting...!

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:11.720
This is way tougher than the dance lessons.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:14.810
But... I won't give up!

00:05:15.020 --> 00:05:18.310
This is something I've decided on my own...!

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:26.110
Looking like a pro there...

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:29.780
But, she doesn't have the
expressions of a wrestler yet.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.950
Hey, who said you can rest?

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.250
Let's start with the spars.

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:38.080
Huh?!

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:40.500
Hurry up and get in the ring!

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.420
First, the throws!

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:47.510
Backdrop!

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:52.260
What?! A power move already?!

00:05:52.470 --> 00:05:55.470
Ryo-<i>san</i>! That's way too harsh!

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:59.730
I'm not a novice to making her hurt.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:01.610
Next, joint holds!

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.230
Armbar Lock!

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:06.190
Spinning Toe Hold!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:08.320
Owww...!

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.030
Did you hear that? "Owww..."

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.410
Well, that does seriously hurt.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.370
But isn't this her first day?

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.660
Maybe Ryo-<i>san</i> is trying to make her quit.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:19.830
Next, choke holds!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.790
This is a Triangle Choke!

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.630
And this...

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:31.640
is the STF!

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:45.020
What's the matter? Down already?!

00:06:45.230 --> 00:06:46.150
Ryo-<i>san</i>!

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:49.610
Even we can't keep up
with that hard of a routine!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:51.990
Being forced to take care
of an idol fooling around...

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:55.450
I mean, we know how
you may be angry, but...

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.830
I can't be stumbling here...

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:10.380
I need to beat her as soon as
I can and go back to Sweet Diva...!

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:14.140
I can still do this!

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:16.640
Please show me the next move!

00:07:17.310 --> 00:07:17.970
No way!

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.890
Seriously?!

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:22.100
She's...

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:24.190
the real deal!

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:26.270
Please!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:29.940
As good as Misaki Toyoda? No. Maybe...

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:35.320
She might change the
history of girls' pro wrestling!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.500
President's Room

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:50.400
So? How was she, Toyoda?

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:53.610
Physique, resilience...

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:56.360
I believe both are at a high level.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:09:01.030
But, she still doesn't know
what real pro wrestling is about.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:05.870
That could be why she's
able to move blindly without fear.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:08.500
As harsh as usual, aren't you, Misaki?

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:09.960
Ryo-<i>san...</i>

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:14.800
So, that "test" is still
too early for Sakura Hagiwara?

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:19.260
But, I understand why
you want to bet on her.

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:23.100
If you allow me to sit out of it

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:26.020
then I have nothing to say
about having her take the test.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:29.020
Well, that actually works better.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:33.780
Hagiwara facing Misaki
is far too early for her.

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:37.110
Alright then, get her ready
for the final test before her debut.

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:43.160
Will do. We'll see for ourselves
if she really has it in her!

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.590
Everyone...

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:56.050
Hagiwara.

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:58.550
Ryo-<i>san</i> is calling.
Get to the training room.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.430
Y-Yes!

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:04.600
Everyone is doing
their best. I won't give up!

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:08.350
Excuse me! I'm sorry for being late!

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:10.480
Finally here.

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:11.810
Ryo-<i>san</i>?

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:14.900
Get ready. Everyone's waiting.

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.730
Everyone?

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:23.950
Wh-What's this?! Rio-<i>san</i> too?!

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.240
Hagiwara...

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.200
How long have you been here?

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:31.370
Huh? Um, three months.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:32.830
I see...

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:36.670
Well then, don't you want
to stand in the ring with pros?

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:37.840
Pros?

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:41.720
I'm asking you if you want to
debut as a professional wrestler.

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.680
Y-Yes, please!

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:47.640
But, that isn't my call.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:48.480
Huh?

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:56.110
They'll see if you have what it takes
to carry the name of Berserk to the ring.

00:10:56.770 --> 00:11:01.110
Right. We have our
way of handling things here.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:04.450
Now then, the final test to the debut...

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:08.950
is a Berserk traditional.
Our hellish Hundred Throws!

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:18.050
Hundred Throws...?

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:23.940
Ten of our wrestlers will
each use ten throw moves on you.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.690
That's a hundred in total.

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:29.690
Handle this, and you'll get your pro debut.

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:32.820
One... hundred...

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:35.160
So? Do you want to do this?

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:41.580
Yes, please!

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:46.170
I've come this far to get
into the professional ring!

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.790
Well, let's get this going then.

00:11:53.550 --> 00:11:55.050
One!

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:58.890
I'm not going easy.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:04.430
This much damage with just one throw?!

00:12:04.640 --> 00:12:06.520
I muffled my landing, but...

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:09.310
can I really take a hundred of these?!

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:12.570
No! I'll take them all!

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:14.860
Next one, please!

00:12:15.070 --> 00:12:16.740
Quite a spirit there.

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:19.120
Let's continue!

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.540
Twelve!

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.540
Twenty-seven!

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.670
Fifty-two!

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:34.630
Seventy-five!

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:38.010
Eighty-eight!

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:44.520
What's the matter, Hagiwara!

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:48.020
The pain! I feel like vomiting...!

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:51.520
But... I'm not over yet...!

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:53.980
Is that it?!

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:54.860
No!

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:56.950
Eighty-nine!

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.580
Not... yet!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:12.000
Not yet!

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.380
Ninety!

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.060
She should be at her limits already.

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:35.070
I didn't even think
she would make it this far.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.900
Well, for this being her
first time, she did pretty...

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:41.450
Not yet...

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:43.990
Hey! Don't overdo yourself.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.450
You've done enough...

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:49.750
What? Out of breath already?

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:53.710
No way I can face a chump like you now.

00:13:53.920 --> 00:13:57.420
One wrong move and
you'd just bite the dust.

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:01.930
Th-The final ten throws, please...!

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:11.140
I'm not gonna be
responsible for what happens.

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:15.270
Ninety-one!

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:20.360
C'mon, what's the matter?!

00:14:21.570 --> 00:14:25.330
That spirit you displayed
when you dropkicked me...

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:28.370
Show it to me!

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:31.160
No... My conscious...!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:43.130
M-My breath... I can't breathe...!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:45.640
This isn't over yet!

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:48.430
C'mon, make this more interesting for me!

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:50.100
Ninety-four!

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:53.730
Ninety-eight!

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:55.810
Ninety-nine!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:58.820
Hah!

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:00.860
How's that?!

00:15:01.070 --> 00:15:05.070
You're way too green to become a pro!

00:15:25.840 --> 00:15:27.510
One hundred!

00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:32.980
This... is it!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:56.210
What's the matter, Hagiwara?! Stand up!

00:15:57.710 --> 00:16:01.460
If you don't stand up,
that last one won't count!

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:02.510
Stand!

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.300
C'mon, stand up!

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:06.380
- Stand! Stand up, Hagiwara!
- What's the matter?!

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.430
- Hagiwara!
- Stand up, Hagiwara!

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:10.390
- Stand up, Hagiwara!
- Hagiwara!

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.020
Hagiwara!

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:31.120
She... stood up!

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:34.160
Alright! You pass!

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:35.830
Sakura Hagiwara.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:38.000
You're ready for your pro debut!

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:41.460
I... did it...!

00:16:42.550 --> 00:16:43.960
Hagiwara?!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:46.470
Are you alright?! Hey!

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.890
You went easy on the last throw.

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:50.430
Why?

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:53.770
It's an inconvenience if she doesn't go pro.

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:56.640
I've got unfinished business with her...

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:59.150
Not honest as usual, I see.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:02.610
Yes, she's just awkward.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:11.510
Weekly Girls' Pro!

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.430
Sakura Hagiwara's Pro Debut!

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:31.510
An amateur like you isn't in the
league to step in here anymore!

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:34.760
As long as I'm not an
amateur, then it's okay, right?

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:37.600
Alright. It's my debut match!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:42.610
It's been four months since
the <i>Cabellera Contra Cabellera</i> match.

00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:45.650
The time has finally come!

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:49.610
Sakura Hagiwara's debut match!

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:54.530
Her debut is against the second
year wrestler, Chinatsu Suzumoto.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:56.490
Body stature-wise, they're about equals...

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:59.080
but she's the number one
wrestler showing growth now.

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:04.000
Just don't get yourself
beaten too quick, Sakura-<i>chan.</i>

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:22.850
"Congratulations on your debut match"
"Sakura Hagiwara"

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:07.670
Awesome... Sakura-<i>chan</i> is awesome!

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:10.510
She's actually having her pro debut!

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:12.430
Even if she shines on a different stage...

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:15.810
we'll always be
Sakura Hagiwara's fans for life!

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:16.890
Of course!

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:21.600
We're gonna have Sakura-<i>chan</i>
use our cheers for her power!

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:22.730
Ready...!

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:26.520
Super-cute, Super-cute, Sa-ku-ra!

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:29.650
Sakura-<i>chan</i>! Do your best!

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:48.760
You can't get away like that!

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:50.590
Ouch...!

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:57.930
One!

00:18:58.140 --> 00:18:59.600
Two!

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:02.600
Surprise results?!

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:05.060
That was so close, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:19:05.270 --> 00:19:07.150
Just a little more...!

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:10.780
That worked! I'll go
with a German Suplex again...

00:19:13.150 --> 00:19:15.450
No! I let my guard down!

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:22.620
Go for an escape! Get to the ropes!

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:26.670
That's right... The ropes!
If I can grab the ropes...

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:29.630
I can get out of this hold...!

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:34.470
Not if I can help it!

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:39.680
Whoa! Suzumoto is dragging
Hagiwara back to the center of the ring!

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:41.470
N-Not again...!

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.850
Owww...!

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:45.940
The Boston Crab hold again!

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.520
Hagiwara's body is
bent backwards in a crescent!

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:52.280
That's going to hurt!

00:19:57.950 --> 00:20:01.740
It hurts... I feel like I'm going to die...!

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:03.080
But...

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:06.460
I survived through that!

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:10.130
I-I'm not going to let this...!

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:14.090
Hagiwara?

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:26.980
N-No...! Different...
This is totally different!

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:29.650
This is the professional ring...

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:33.360
This is their stage they risk their lives on!

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:36.740
Hagiwara?

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:40.370
Hagiwara?

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:42.660
Give...

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.500
...up!

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:49.040
Hagiwara gives up!

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.500
She starts her debut match
with a harsh blotch on her record!

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:57.760
Sakura-<i>chan</i>! You did your best!

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:00.640
That was amazing!
So different from the last time!

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:03.970
You really trained
hard the past four months!

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:07.980
That was really fun.

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:09.980
Let's do this again!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.610
Yes...

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:14.900
Misaki?

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.900
I knew you'd come.

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:19.740
Well, it is our rookie's match, you know?

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:22.330
Sakura-<i>chan</i> did pretty good.

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:25.330
She may have lost today, but at this rate...

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.660
That's going to be difficult.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:28.210
What?

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:32.380
It's going to take a
lot longer for her first win.

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:42.680
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:45.430
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:50.190
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:53.060
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:57.570 --> 00:22:02.740
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:08.370
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:13.830
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:17.880
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:22:18.090 --> 00:22:19.010
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:22:19.220 --> 00:22:21.680
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:24.350
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:22:24.550 --> 00:22:31.730
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:22:31.940 --> 00:22:37.860
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:22:38.070 --> 00:22:39.070
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:40.700
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:48.790
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:50.410
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:22:50.620 --> 00:22:54.380
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:54.580 --> 00:22:55.630
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:57.170
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:57.380 --> 00:22:59.670
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:01.130
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:23:01.340 --> 00:23:04.720
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:23:04.930 --> 00:23:07.560
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:35.760
Episode 03: Give Up!

00:23:11.520 --> 00:23:13.890
Chief, we're in a bind.

00:23:14.100 --> 00:23:17.650
Our number one girl,
Sakura-<i>chan</i> is racking up the losses.

00:23:17.860 --> 00:23:19.980
She's on a slippery slide to the bottom.

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:21.820
She's being booed by the wrestling fans.

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:24.950
Even the fans from her
idol days are starting to give up.

00:23:25.160 --> 00:23:27.240
Contrary to that, Sweet Diva is on a roll!

00:23:27.450 --> 00:23:30.160
Sakura-<i>chan</i> seems
really pressured here, but...

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:32.580
she won't quit pro wrestling, will she?!

00:23:32.790 --> 00:23:35.500
C'mon, Misaki! Help her out here!

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:40.640
A request from Sakura:

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:40.640
There are a lot of pro wrestling moves in "Sekatsuyo,"
but they're dangerous, so please don't try them at home!
